%% FIG-020 — RAG and evidence-to-claim pipeline (section 11)
flowchart TD
  R[Reference: Trusted] --> SD[Source Document]
  SD --> EX[Extract text + structure]
  EX --> CH[Chunk: passageId, page, section]
  CH --> EM[Embed]
  EM --> VDB[(Vector database<br/>filter: accountId + referenceId)]
  Q[Task / question] --> ERA[Evidence Retrieval Agent]
  ERA -->|query + project reference filter| VDB
  VDB --> EV[Evidence: referenceId, passageId, verbatim text]
  EV --> SA[Synthesis Agent]
  SA --> CL[Claim: Draft]
  CL --> LK[Claim-Evidence Link<br/>supports / contradicts / context]
  LK --> VA[Verification Agent]
  VA --> SS{Support status}
  SS --> HR[Researcher review APR-06]
  HR -->|Accepted| WR[Writing Agent - section 12]
